{{>layouts/header}}

<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div class="page-title" style="margin-bottom:0;">현재 환율</div>
    <span class="utag {{#realTime}}utag-ok{{/realTime}}{{^realTime}}utag-soon{{/realTime}}">
        {{#realTime}}실시간{{/realTime}}{{^realTime}}폴백{{/realTime}}
    </span>
</div>

<div class="detail-card">
    <div class="detail-rows">
        <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-row-label">🇺🇸 달러 (USD)</span>
            <span class="detail-row-value v-accent">1 달러 = {{usdRate}} 원</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-row-label">🇯🇵 엔 (JPY)</span>
            <span class="detail-row-value v-accent">1 엔 = {{jpyRate}} 원</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
            <span class="detail-row-label">🇰🇷 원 (KRW)</span>
            <span class="detail-row-value">1 원 = 1 원</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<p class="rate-note">
    출처: ExchangeRate-API (open.er-api.com) · 매일 자정 자동 갱신
    {{#lastUpdated}} · 마지막 갱신: {{lastUpdated}}{{/lastUpdated}}
</p>

{{#lastError}}
<div class="error-detail" style="margin-top:12px;">
    API 호출 실패: {{lastError}}
</div>
{{/lastError}}

<form action="/rates/refresh" method="post" style="margin-top:16px;">
    <button type="submit" class="btn" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
        ↻ 지금 환율 갱신
    </button>
</form>

{{>layouts/footer}}
